{
 "_id": "B0FGULtttLUhFXig",
 "name": "Vengeful Fury",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/feature.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p>At 3rd level, you are filled with a deep hatred filled by vengeance, making you ignore everything and let anger consume you. As a bonus action you can enter your fury state if you're not wearing heavy armor, gaining the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>When you take bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing damage, you reduce the damage by your proficiency bonus.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You deal one additional dice of damage whenever you score a critical hit with a melee weapon.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Your fury lasts for 1 minute. It ends early if you are knocked unconscious or if your turn ends and you haven't attacked a hostile creature since your last turn or taken damage since then. You can also end your rage state on your turn as a bonus action.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>You can enter your fury a number of times up to your proficiency bonus, and recover all uses upon a short or long rest.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
   "chat": ""
  },
